      "review_description": "Had been thinking about having solar panels for several years and noticed a neighbour having them installed.  We were impressed with how neat the work was, so of course, on enquiring found that the installers were Derwent Electrical. Hubby had a chat with Sam, quote was given, was impressed with price and not long long after we had our solar panels installed. Sam and his workers were polite  and hard working. Sam sat down with me after the panels were up and running  and explained how it all worked. He also had the “Monacle” downloaded on my iPad and explained how it worked.I get a lot of pleasure checking the Monacle app as it shows not only the amount of solar energy that is coming in, but what energy is being used within our home and how much is being exported back to the grid.I can honestly say that it has been an absolute pleasure to have chosen Sam and his team to install our panels.",
